-- Hungary deep-dive content (English). A genuinely distinct shape for
-- this tracker: RTIR is a mature (2018-), near-universal, real-time
-- transaction-DATA reporting regime -- not itself an e-invoicing format
-- mandate, since the underlying invoice can stay paper or PDF -- layered
-- underneath a narrow, genuine e-invoicing ISSUANCE mandate that only
-- applies to one sector (energy/water B2B, from July 2025), with a
-- receipt-reporting expansion arriving September 2026 and a comprehensive
-- future B2B/B2G framework still at the consultation stage. Closest
-- precedent in this tracker is Czech Republic's EET-vs-invoicing
-- distinction, but Hungary's RTIR is far more mature and its data-vs-
-- format split runs through nearly every milestone, not just one.









